:: Carter House Intro Part 2 [nobr]

/* Intro */
Changed and ready to swim, you exit <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span>’s room and follow his earlier tour to the kitchen, where the boy sits waiting by the open door on a kitchen stool. He smiles excitedly upon seeing you. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“You ready? Come on!”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> leaps from the stool and grabs you by the hand, pulling you out the backdoor to his yard. <br>
<br>
You’ve seen it before, though now get a proper look. <span style="Color:LightGreen">A nice, fancy patio with chairs and a grill, a decent sized pool with a slide and diving board, a trampoline, and even a small jungle gym with an attached swing set. You are left a gasp by how exciting his backyard is and can’t help but point it out.</span> <br>

    <<set _ad to [
        {
            Name: "Player",
            State: {
                Mouth: "Happy",
            },
        },
        {
            Name: "Carter",
            State: {
                Outfit: "Swim",
                Mouth: "Happy",
            },
        },
    ]>>
    <<ad _ad>>

<span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“It’s cool, right? It’s like a playground in our backyard!”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> replies excitedly. <br>
<br>
<span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“We do alright.”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span>’s father says, painting the new board looking a tad embarrassed, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“It also is kind of hard to say no, especially with everything <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> does around the house.”</span> His praise causes <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> to blush happily. His good deeds certainly have been rewarded here. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Oh, and <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span>, before you jump in you probably should-”</span> <span style="Color:LightGreen">But his words are lost on the hyperactive lad as he jumps and splashes into the pool with an impressive cannonball. <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Mr. Kent</span> sighs as <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> surfaces giggling.</span> <br>
<br>
<span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Come on! Bet you can’t do a bigger splash than me!”</span> He laughs as you follow behind, jumping into the pool with glee. <span style="Color:Pink">It is as you are underwater that you see something curious, a pair of red trunks floating under the water. You look up at your friend to see <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span>’s bare little butt. Seems the boy’s sudden dive had caused him to unintentionally skinny dip. You grab the trunks before you surface, seeing how loose the drawstring is. You get the feeling this is what his father was going to tell him to do before jumping in.</span> <br>

        <<set _ad to [
            {
                Name: "Player",
                State: {
                    Mouth: "Smirk",
                    Blush: 1,
                },
