            {
                Name: "Carter",
                ShowZoom: true,
                State: {
                    Outfit: "Naked",
                    Mouth: "Happy",
                },
            },
        ]>>
        <<ad _ad>>

<span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Let’s try the diving board!”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> begins to swim to the ladder, <span style="Color:Pink">completely oblivious to his nude butt as it pokes out, shiny and cute. You turn to his father, who was also watching with an amused smirk, giving you a humorous eyeroll. You’d guess <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> losing his trunks is a pretty common occurrence.</span> <br>
<br>

