        You whistle to get <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span>’s attention, holding up the trunks with a laugh. <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> tilts his head at you confused. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Huh? Where did you get-?”</span> <span style="Color:Pink">He pauses, you can see the gears turning in his head as he slowly looks down and sees his little grape exposed in the open water.</span> There is then another second of processing before- <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Ahhh!”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> <span style="Color:Pink">splashes his hands into the water to cover himself. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“T- toss them over!”</span> Both you and his father laugh as you throw over his trunks, watching with amusement as he struggles to put them on his red cheeks.</span> <br>

