        <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“I told you before, the knots come undone in the wash, so you need to retie them before jumping in.”</span> His father laughs, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Unless you want your friend to see your little butt.”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> <span style="Color:Pink">sinks lower in the water, blowing bubbles out of embarrassment as you swim over and pat him on the back, saying it’s fine since you’ve seen his little butt plenty of times by now. You both laugh again as <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> sinks fully under the water.</span> <br>
