        You both watch as <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> reaches the ladder and climbs out. <span style="Color:Pink">He is completely oblivious to how exposed he is as he climbs. As he lifts his leg up to climb out, you can’t help but eye the boy’s exposed, tight hole and his tiny little balls dangling between his legs. He even does a cute little superhero pose as he stands and begins to run over to the diving board.</span> <br>
        <br>
        <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Hey! No running!”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span>’s father says, causing the boy to stop in his tracks and apologize with a shy smile, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Oh, and <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span>? I don’t mind you swimming however you want, but maybe make sure your friend is okay with you running around like this? Not everyone wants to see that.”</span> <span style="Color:Pink">You blurt out that you don’t mind the view as <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> looks at you both with confusion.</span> <br>
        <br>
        <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Huh? What are you talking about?”</span> He tilts his head, staring at you, registering the red trunks in your hand. <span style="Color:Pink">You can see the gears turning behind his eyes as he slowly looks down, seeing his nude, dripping wet body shining in the sun, and suddenly makes a noise of utter embarrassment as he quickly crouches down and tries to cover himself with his hands. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Aahhh! T- toss me my trunks!”</span> You and his father both laugh as you do so, watching as the red-faced boy scrambles to put his trunks on. He ties the drawstring tight before slipping back in the water shyly.</span> <br>

